     "kind": "needs_new_primitive",
     "replaces": "full causal self-attention",
     "reason": "Banded causal attention where each query attends only to the previous w keys of a window that differs per layer (small in lower layers, increasing upward), with per-head dilation d (gaps of size d between attended positions; nonzero on only 2 heads in upper layers), combined with Transformer-XL relative sinusoidal position terms. The attention op only supports one window with dilation 1 and has no relative-position bias.",
